{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myrkwood: Offshoot is a top-down survival defense game that you can play with your friends! Spawn with 5 other people and defend the objective, the Gem, as Bombrats and hordes of monsters attempt to try to crack it. Dodge, slash, &amp; fight as you attempt to try to get the highest waves survived. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online/local multiplayer - You and 5 other players can join the same lobby and defend the Gem together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop - Buy upgrades &amp; items to help you defend the Gem!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat - Chat with your friends to help coordinate and communicate better!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice pixel art graphics! Well, at least we think so.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless waves! Fight through endless waves with increasing difficulty.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy variants! Enemies become more difficult by becoming stronger and having multiple powers to try to kill you! :)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951230?t=1756910704","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951230?t=1756910704","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951230/eb4fb06f57ae8f22cbc36286d1bfd3834771e563/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756910704","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951230/eb4fb06f57ae8f22cbc36286d1bfd3834771e563/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756910704","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myrkwood: Offshoot is a 